---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout
  title="How We Work | Otter Homecare"
  description="From your first call to ongoing support — how Otter Homecare gets to know you and builds care around your life. Flexible visit lengths, a small local team, real-time Care App updates."
>
  <header class="phero"><div class="wrap"><div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> · How We Work</div><h1>A simple, reassuring process</h1><p>From your first call to ongoing support, here's how we get to know you and build care around your life.</p></div></header>

  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="steps-grid">
    <div class="step reveal"><span class="step-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .4 1.9.7 2.8a2 2 0 0 1-.4 2.1L8 9.9a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.8.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.8 2z"></path></svg><span class="step-num">1</span></span><h3>Call us</h3><p>Complimentary, expert guidance tailored to your needs.</p></div>
    <div class="step reveal"><span class="step-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"></path><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"></path></svg><span class="step-num">2</span></span><h3>Home visit</h3><p>Our qualified manager visits to create your tailored care plan.</p></div>
    <div class="step reveal"><span class="step-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.7l-1-1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8l1 1L12 21l7.8-7.6 1-1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8z"></path></svg><span class="step-num">3</span></span><h3>Start care</h3><p>Your matched Care Professional begins support on your terms.</p></div>
    <div class="step reveal"><span class="step-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M23 4v6h-6"></path><path d="M1 20v-6h6"></path><path d="M3.5 9a9 9 0 0 1 14.8-3.4L23 10M1 14l4.7 4.4A9 9 0 0 0 20.5 15"></path></svg><span class="step-num">4</span></span><h3>Ongoing</h3><p>We review and adapt your care as your needs change.</p></div>
  </div></div></section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:44px;padding-bottom:0"><div class="wrap"><div class="ww-photos reveal">
    <figure class="ww-photo"><span class="ww-note">a familiar face, every visit<svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5 C 8 22 18 31 33 33" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M33 33 L 25 31 M33 33 L 31 25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><img src="/img/ww-visit.jpg" alt="An Otter Care Professional with a client at home" /></figure>
    <figure class="ww-photo r"><span class="ww-note"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M35 5 C 32 22 22 31 7 33" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M7 33 L 15 31 M7 33 L 9 25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>good enough for my own dad</span><img src="/img/founder-dad.jpg" alt="Jamie, our founder, with his father" /></figure>
  </div></div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="head-c reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Why families choose us</span><h2>What makes us different</h2></div><div class="perks-grid reveal">
    <div class="perk"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/heart.svg" alt="" /></div><h3>Good enough for Dad</h3><p>We only hire carers we'd trust to look after our own families — in fact, our carers support Jamie's own dad.</p></div>
    <div class="perk"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/team.svg" alt="" /></div><h3>A small, dedicated team</h3><p>We keep our team tight-knit, so carers really get to know each client and their family.</p></div>
    <div class="perk"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/pin.svg" alt="" /></div><h3>Local and personal</h3><p>We're based in Trowbridge and just around the corner — always close by and ready to help.</p></div>
    <div class="perk"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/phone.svg" alt="" /></div><h3>Care app for transparency</h3><p>Family members see real-time updates from every visit, for total peace of mind.</p></div>
    <div class="perk"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/clock.svg" alt="" /></div><h3>Visits that suit you</h3><p>From a quick check-in to a full day together — care that flexes around your life, never rushed.</p></div>
    <div class="perk"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/mug.svg" alt="" /></div><h3>Otter Happy Hour</h3><p>Every client gets a free hour of care each month to enjoy something special, just for them.</p></div>
  </div></div></section>

  <section class="section tmt"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px"><div class="head-c reveal"><h2>What to expect</h2></div><ul class="checklist reveal"><li>A free, no-obligation home visit</li><li>A care plan built around your routine</li><li>Carers carefully matched to you</li><li>A small, familiar team — not strangers</li><li>Real-time updates via our Care App</li><li>Regular reviews as needs change</li></ul></div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;text-align:center"><div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Our "Good Enough for Dad" promise</span><h2 style="font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,38px);margin:10px 0 14px">If our care is good enough for my own family, it's good enough for yours</h2><blockquote style="font-family:'Spectral';font-style:italic;font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);max-width:34ch;margin:0 auto">When my dad had a stroke, I saw first-hand how important the right care is. Today, our Care Professionals support him with the same patience and compassion they bring to every client.</blockquote><div style="margin-top:16px;font-weight:800">Jamie Rowland-Jones <span style="display:block;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted)">Founder, Otter Homecare</span></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="section book"><div class="wrap" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;display:block;text-align:center">
    <div class="reveal" style="max-width:36ch;margin:0 auto">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#9fc4bf">Free, no-obligation assessment</span>
      <h2 style="margin:14px 0 12px">Let's find the right care, together</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:26px;color:#bfe0dc">Speak to a real, local person today — never a call centre.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:13px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <a class="btn btn-clay btn-lg" href="/#book">Book a free assessment</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="tel:01225690022" style="background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.5)">Call 01225 690022</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="book-trust reveal">
      <div class="bt-ticks"><span>Free, no-obligation home visit</span><span>A care plan built around you</span><span>We usually reply the same day</span></div>
      <div class="bt-stars"><span class="s">★★★★★</span> Rated <b>9.4</b> by families on homecare.co.uk</div>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</SiteLayout>
